}, w} \\\), applying smoothing with a rolling window average, and training a linear regression model\ to predict residuals. The process adjusts XGBoost predictions by predicted residuals and returns adjusted weekly volatility \\\( \\hat{v}_w \\\).\r\n␀)/K 25/P 17908 0 R/Pg 710 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj17978 0 obj<</K 2/P 17908 0 R/Pg 710 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj17979 0 obj<</K 3/P 17908 0 R/Pg 710 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj17980 0 obj<</K[18186 0 R 18187 0 R 18188 0 R 18189 0 R 18190 0 R]/P 17908 0 R/S/L/Type/StructElem>>endobj17981 0 obj<</K 2/P 17908 0 R/Pg 717 0 R/S/H2/Type/StructElem>>endobj17982 0 obj<</K[4 18180 0 R 6 18181 0 R 8 18182 0 R 10]/P 17908 0 R/Pg 717 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj17983 0 obj<</K[18139 0 R 18140 0 R 18141 0 R 18142 0 R]/P 17908 0 R/S/Table/Type/StructElem>>endobj17984 0 obj<</A 18138 0 R/Alt(Line chart comparing actual and predicted values over time from November 2021 to July 2023. The x-axis represents time, while the y-axis shows the value range from 0.0 to 0.6. Two lines are plotted: a blue line for actual values and a red line for predict\ed values. The chart shows fluctuations with several peaks and troughs throughout the period. A legend on the right identifies the lines.␀)/K 44/P 17908 0 R/Pg 717 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj17985 0 obj<</K 45/P 17908 0 R/Pg 717 0 R/S/Caption/Type/StructElem>>endobj17986 0 obj<</K[47 18136 0 R 49]/P 17908 0 R/Pg 717 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj17987 0 obj<</K[18105 0 R 18106 0 R 18107 0 R 18108 0 R]/P 17908 0 R/S/Table/Type/StructElem>>endobj17988 0 obj<</K[18022 0 R 18023 0 R 18024 0 R 18025 0 R]/P 17908 0 R/S/Table/Type/StructElem>>endobj17989 0 obj<</K[97 18020 0 R 99]/P 17908 0 R/Pg 721 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj17990 0 obj<</K[18008 0 R 18009 0 R 18010 0 R]/P 17908 0 R/S/L/Type/StructElem>>endobj17991 0 obj<</K 106/P 17908 0 R/Pg 721 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj17992 0 obj<</A 18007 0 R/Alt(Bar chart titled "Feature Importance" displaying the importance scores of various features. The x-axis lists features: "volatility_lag_1," "close_price," "volatility_lag_5," "day_of_week," "week_of_year," "volatility_lag_2," and "volatility_lag_15." The y\-axis represents the importance score, ranging from 0 to 80. "Volatility_lag_1" has the highest score, followed by "close_price" and others in descending order.)/K 2/P 17908 0 R/Pg 726 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj17993 0 obj<</K 3/P 17908 0 R/Pg 726 0 R/S/Caption/Type/StructElem>>endobj17994 0 obj<</K 5/P 17908 0 R/Pg 726 0 R/S/H2/Type/StructElem>>endobj17995 0 obj<</K 7/P 17908 0 R/Pg 726 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj17996 0 obj<</K 8/P 17908 0 R/Pg 726 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj17997 0 obj<</K 12/P 17908 0 R/Pg 726 0 R/S/H2/Type/StructElem>>endobj17998 0 obj<</K 16/P 17908 0 R/Pg 726 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj17999 0 obj<</K 18/P 17908 0 R/Pg 726 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj18000 0 obj<</K 20/P 17908 0 R/Pg 726 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj18001 0 obj<</K[22 18005 0 R]/P 17908 0 R/Pg 726 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj18002 0 obj<</K[31 18003 0 R]/P 17908 0 R/Pg 726 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj18003 0 obj<</K 18004 0 R/P 18002 0 R/S/Reference/Type/StructElem>>endobj18004 0 obj<</Alt(Please refer http://www.cs.ucl.ac.uk/fileadmin/UCL-CS/images/Research_Student_Information/RN_11_04.pdf for your more information)/K[<</Obj 5425 0 R/Type/OBJR>>32<</Obj 5414 0 R/Type/OBJR>>33<</Obj 5432 0 R/Type/OBJR>>34<</Obj 5445 0 R/Type/OBJR>>35<</Obj 5426 0 R/Type/OBJR>>36<</Obj 5408 0 R/Type/OBJR>>37<</Obj 5448 0 R/Type/OBJR>>38<</Obj 5450 0 R/Type/OBJR>>39<</Obj 5390 0 R/Type/OBJR>>40<</Obj 5404 0 R/Type/OBJR>>41<</Obj 5403 0 R/Type/OBJR>>42<</Obj 5387 0 R/Type/OBJR>>43<</Obj 5392 0 R/Type/OBJR>>44<</Obj 5395 0 R/Type/OBJR>>45<</Obj 5407 0 R/Type/OBJR>>46<</Obj 5421 0 R/Type/OBJR>>47<</Obj 5412 0 R/Type/OBJR>>48]/P 18003 0 R/Pg 726 0 R/S/Link/Type/StructElem>>endobj18005 